  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><h1 data-id=\"h4kgw8yp6-a22w82bcasw00\" id=\"h4kgw8yp6-a22w82bcasw00\">回调地址</h1><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-9qx3ykhogmw00\">订阅任务设置回调地址</p><h1 data-id=\"h4kgw8yp6-7chx953w34g00\" id=\"h4kgw8yp6-7chx953w34g00\">关联API接口. </h1><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-58gwf8q8saw00\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/security/non_score_disposal_info/get/</p><h1 data-id=\"h4kgw8yp6-iokhgp4hehs00\" id=\"h4kgw8yp6-iokhgp4hehs00\">请求方式</h1><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-azu49ubibaw00\">POST</p><h1 data-id=\"h4kgw8yp6-czk2e3sxzww00\" id=\"h4kgw8yp6-czk2e3sxzww00\">请求Header</h1><section class=\"table spi-table\" data-type=\"spitable\" data-tabletype=\"header\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" width=\"250\" style=\"width: 250px;\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" width=\"120\" style=\"width: 120px;\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Content-Type</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">请求消息类型，允许值：application/json</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">X-Open-Signature</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">签名，用来验证此次请求的合法性，具体算法见<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/docs/1722481732805646\"> 【X-Open-Signature签名校验】</a></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h4kgw8yp6-kn5ori4oqho00\" id=\"h4kgw8yp6-kn5ori4oqho00\">请求参数</h1><h2 data-id=\"h4kgw8yp6-cnxbuj8cxxc00\" id=\"h4kgw8yp6-cnxbuj8cxxc00\">基础信息</h2><section class=\"table spi-table\" data-type=\"spitable\"